  m_Name: Cylinder.004_Chrome.001_0
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  partName: Heat Shield (2)
  description: The Heat Shield (2) is a small, thin-flat component positioned at
    the bottom-center-rear of the engine, serving as a protective barrier against
    excessive heat. Made of Chrome.001, this heat shield is designed to reflect and
    dissipate heat, ensuring the longevity of surrounding components. Notably, its
    chrome material provides excellent corrosion resistance, allowing the heat shield
    to maintain its effectiveness in harsh environments.
